    "MSG_DONTWAIT-only Unix candidate blocked in the unread-peer unit test on this host; rejected, exact owned test/cargo/shell terminated and source retained. It is not the accepted implementation.",
    "First final harness comparison wrongly expected969ad7b to have the pre-fix response behavior.969ad7b already expires response reads at12seconds. Corrected the explicit baseline response expectation and reran; no runtime change was made for that fixture correction. Failed report and harness retained."
